		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=1586#p1586"><![CDATA[
Hi Erwin,<br><br>CollisionWorld::PerformDiscreteCollisionDetection never calls OverlappingPairCache::RefreshOverlappingPairs. <br>If you use just AxisSweep3 this is not a problem since it does not need this call to work properly, but if you use e.g.  the SimpleBroadphase you never get any collisions.<br><br>I believe this is a bug.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=742">CaptainNemo</a> — Fri Aug 25, 2006 4:11 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
